  "name": "Gamma Knife",
  "type": "spell",
  "img": "icons/weapons/daggers/dagger-glowing-white.webp",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You imbue a weapon you touch with deadly power. Until the creation ends, the weapon emits bright light in a 30-foot radius and dim light for an additional 30 feet. In addition, weapon attacks made with it deal an extra 2d8 radiant or necrotic damage (your choice) on a hit.\nAs a bonus action on your turn, you can dismiss this creation and cause the weapon to emit a deadly burst. Each creature of your choice that you can see within 30 feet of the weapon must make a Constitution saving throw. On a failed save, a creature takes 6d8 of the chosen damage type, and it is blinded for 1 minute. On a successful save, a creature takes half as much damage and isn’t blinded. At the end of each of its turns, a blinded creature can make a Constitution saving throw, ending the effect on itself on a success.</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
